  "natspec": {
    "functions": {
      "0x01e4d72a": {
        "notice": "Called before any transfers. Return `authorizeOrder.selector` (`0x01e4d72a`) to authorize."
      },
      "0x1a5194be": {
        "notice": "The role that blocks an address from being an order's offerer or fulfiller."
      },
      "0x2e778efc": {
        "notice": "SIP introspection: the zone's name + supported schemas."
      },
      "0x50dacc83": {
        "notice": "Whether `collection` requires its ERC-2981 royalty to be present in the order's consideration."
      },
      "0x16c38b3c": {
        "notice": "Sets the global pause flag. Admin only."
      },
      "0xd98a7d79": {
        "notice": "Toggles ERC-2981 royalty enforcement for `collection`. Admin only."
      },
      "0x17b1f942": {
        "notice": "Called after all transfers. Return `validateOrder.selector` (`0x17b1f942`) to validate."
      },
      "0x1a405ea4": {
        "notice": "Whether the zone is paused. (Named `zonePaused` to avoid the `Pausable` facet's `paused()` selector.)"
      }
    },
    "notice": "Seaport 1.6 zone facet. The Diamond acts as the `zone` for RESTRICTED orders trading its tokens, authorizing them only when policy holds: not paused, offerer/fulfiller not blocked, and the ERC-2981 royalty present for opt-in collections.",
    "dev": "Stateless delegator — logic/storage live in {MarketplaceZoneLib}. `authorizeOrder` enforces pause + blocklist (pre-fulfillment, skippable); `validateOrder` enforces royalties (post-fulfillment, final amounts). Each returns its own selector as Seaport's magic value, else reverts. v1 of #25 — the `ContractOffererInterface` (AMM-priced orders) facet is a separate v2 deliverable."
  },
